      "source": [
        "# Import path\n",
        "\n",
        "The import path is a list of locations searched by the path-based finder when importing modules. It normally comes from `sys.path`, or a package's `__path__` for its submodules.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-import-path)"
      ]
    }
  ],
